              "text": "<evidence id=\"E2\" kind=\"text\" label=\"client chat export\">\nOrder WEB-3315 · Client chat export (synthetic sample)\n\n[2026-09-03 12:00] Lotus Yoga Studio: Photos for the gallery are in the shared folder.\n[2026-09-28 21:14] Dev Arora Web: The site is live at lotusyoga.example.test. Screenshot attached.\n[2026-09-29 08:30] Lotus Yoga Studio: Looks lovely on my laptop. I sent a test message through the form and it arrived in our inbox.\n[2026-09-30 17:05] Lotus Yoga Studio: Where is the gallery page? I only see Home, About, Classes and Contact in the menu.\n\n</evidence>"
